('Obby 30: Color Rush','obby-30-color-rush-gm81366','Are you ready to go from beginner to master? Obby 30: Color Rush is a classic 3D platformer that takes you through 30 flawlessly designed levels. Start in the easy green zones and fight your way through fiery red trials, where every platform tests your patience and precision. What awaits inside:  30 Levels of Evolution: Feel your skills grow with every step. Level design isn''t just about traps - it''s about speed and reflex puzzles.  Star System: Simply finishing is only the beginning. Collect all the in-game stars to prove you are the true Obby champion!  Race Against Time: Confident in your speed? Run as fast as you can!','Are you ready to go from beginner to master? Obby 30: Color Rush is a classic 3D platformer that takes you through 30 flawlessly designed levels. Start in the e','https://img.gamemonetize.com/dcdoe6b5ajfv2f1r1cefnv6paq6ole25/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/dcdoe6b5ajfv2f1r1cefnv6paq6ole25/','GAMEMONETIZE','81366',12,'{"3D","3D Games","Arcade","Avoid","Casual","Hypercasual","Jumping","Minecraft","Obstacle","Platform"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,11340),
('Liquid Color Sort','liquid-color-sort-gm81000','Enjoy a fun and relaxing puzzle experience in Liquid Color Sort! Your objective is to sort colorful liquids into separate tubes until each tube contains only one color. Use logic, planning, and problem-solving skills to complete each level. While the rules are simple, the puzzles become more challenging as new colors and tube arrangements are introduced. Think carefully before each move and find the most efficient way to organize the liquids. With satisfying animations and calming gameplay, Liquid Color Sort is perfect for players who enjoy brain-training puzzles and relaxing challenges.','Enjoy a fun and relaxing puzzle experience in Liquid Color Sort! Your objective is to sort colorful liquids into separate tubes until each tube contains only on','https://img.gamemonetize.com/7qkj72xabfgbojt1gr2nl4elzpom74q6/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/7qkj72xabfgbojt1gr2nl4elzpom74q6/','GAMEMONETIZE','81000',1,'{"2D","Casual","Fun","Hypercasual","Puzzle"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,7864),
