('ReefRescue','reefrescue-gm81278','ReefRescue is a fun underwater adventure where every piece of trash you collect helps protect the ocean! Take control of a brave little seahorse and swim through colorful reefs, collecting floating waste while carefully avoiding fish and other sea creatures. Stay alert, react quickly, and keep the ocean clean without disturbing marine life. With simple controls and engaging gameplay, ReefRescue is easy to pick up and enjoyable for players of all ages. Challenge your reflexes, improve your timing, and become the hero of the reef!','ReefRescue is a fun underwater adventure where every piece of trash you collect helps protect the ocean! Take control of a brave little seahorse and swim throug','https://img.gamemonetize.com/ranyzu94kueenqvnwuxf5saub5uumdwl/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/ranyzu94kueenqvnwuxf5saub5uumdwl/','GAMEMONETIZE','81278',12,'{"Animal","Casual","catch","water"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,2490),
('PondHero','pondhero-gm81275','PondHero is a fun and challenging memory puzzle adventure where every step matters! Study the safe path as it appears across the pond, then watch it disappear. Your mission is to guide the brave little frog along the exact same route using only your memory. One wrong move, and youll have to try again! As you progress, the paths become longer, trickier, and more rewarding. Test your memory, improve your concentration, and see if you can conquer every challenge. Game Features: 40+ handcrafted levels with increasing difficulty Simple one-touch controls Fun memory-based gameplay thats easy to learn Cute frog and colorful pond-themed visuals','PondHero is a fun and challenging memory puzzle adventure where every step matters! Study the safe path as it appears across the pond, then watch it disappear. ','https://img.gamemonetize.com/i0ls0z1jfyvauimh5g7xlm26r0hjidm0/512x384.jpg','https://html5.gamemonetize.co/i0ls0z1jfyvauimh5g7xlm26r0hjidm0/','GAMEMONETIZE','81275',1,'{"Casual","frog","Memory","Puzzle"}',800,600,true,false,false,true,2185)
